  {id:'maya',name:'Maya Brooks',nick:'Maya',tag:'THE LISTENER',floor:'ground',pos:[-5.3,2.4],color:'#db9779',shirt:'#d4b14e',pants:'#38536b',hat:'#e0bd79',mood:'Thoughtful, a little homesick',line:'I keep thinking about my little sister. I want to be there for her, but I need to get steady first.',rep:50,face:'◡',choices:[['That sounds like a lot to carry. Want to tell me about her?','Listen without trying to fix it.','+ KINDNESS','good',5],['Maybe focus on today. One step at a time, right?','Offer a gentle reminder to stay present.','+ SUPPORT','good',3],['She’ll be fine without you. Don’t worry about it.','Brush off something important to her.','− TRUST','bad',-5]]},
  {id:'darnell',name:'Darnell Price',nick:'Darnell',tag:'THE PEACEMAKER',floor:'ground',pos:[3.7,1.3],color:'#8d624b',shirt:'#587f79',pants:'#4b4662',hat:'#cc734f',mood:'Upbeat, keeping the peace',line:'I’m trying to get everyone to sit down for dinner together. It’d be nice if we could feel like a team.',rep:50,face:'◡',choices:[['I’m in. Let’s see what we can make together.','Offer to help bring people around the table.','+ TEAMWORK','good',5],['That’s thoughtful. I can set out the plates.','Pitch in with a small practical task.','+ KINDNESS','good',4],['Nobody wants to eat together. Save your breath.','Undercut an effort to build community.','− TRUST','bad',-6]]},
