  {id:'rosa',name:'Rosa Martinez',nick:'Rosa',tag:'THE GARDENER',floor:'basement',pos:[-4.6,-1.7],color:'#bd7959',shirt:'#79a678',pants:'#4a5065',hat:'#d7b97a',mood:'Calm, missing her garden',line:'I used to grow tomatoes with my abuela. There’s a sunny patch by the back steps that might work for a few pots.',rep:50,face:'◡',choices:[['Let’s find some pots. It could be a nice project.','Help her make a hopeful plan.','+ TEAMWORK','good',5],['Tell me about what you grew together.','Invite her to share a good memory.','+ CONNECTION','good',5],['Plants take too much work. Forget about it.','Dismiss a small source of joy.','− TRUST','bad',-5]]},
